msgid "Basis set extrapolation"
msgstr "基组外推"

msgid ""
"Basis set extrapolation can be carried out for correlation consistent basis "
"sets using"
msgstr "对于相关一致基组，可以使用以下命令进行基组外推"

msgid "``EXTRAPOLATE,BASIS=basislist,options``"
msgstr "``EXTRAPOLATE,BASIS=basislist,options``"

msgid ""
"where basislist is a list of at least two basis sets separated by colons, "
"e.g. AVTZ:AVQZ:AV5Z. Some extrapolation types need three or more basis sets,"
" others only two. The default is to use :math:`n^{-3}` extrapolation of the "
"correlation energies, and in this case two subsequent basis sets and the "
"corresponding energies are needed. The default is not to extrapolate the "
"reference (HF) energies; the value obtained with the largest basis set is "
"taken as reference energy for the CBS estimate. However, extrapolation of "
"the reference is also possible by specifying the ``METHOD_R`` option."
msgstr ""
"其中 `basislist` 是由冒号分隔的至少两个基组的列表，例如 "
"AVTZ:AVQZ:AV5Z。某些外推类型需要三个或更多基组，而其他类型仅需两个。默认使用相关能的 :math:`n^{-3}` "
"外推，这种情况下需要两个连续的基组及其对应的能量。默认不对参考（HF）能量进行外推；使用最大基组获得的值将作为 CBS 估计的参考能量。然而，通过指定 "
"``METHOD_R`` 选项，也可以对参考能量进行外推。"

msgid ""
"This will perform the first calculation with AVTZ basis, and then compute "
"the estimated basis set limit using the AVQZ and AV5Z basis sets. The "
"correlation energy obtained in the calculation that is performed immediately"
" before the extrapolate command will be extrapolated (in this case the "
"CCSD(T) energy), and the necessary sequence of calculations [here "
"HF;CCSD(T)] will be automatically carried out."
msgstr ""
"这将首先使用 AVTZ 基组进行计算，然后使用 AVQZ 和 AV5Z "
"基组计算估计的基组极限。紧接在外推命令之前执行的计算中获得的相关能将被外推（本例中为 CCSD(T) 能量），并且必要的计算序列 [此处为 "
"HF;CCSD(T)] 将自动执行。"

msgid ""
"The resulting energies are returned in variables ENERGR (reference "
"energies), ENERGY (total energies), and ENERGD (Davidson corrected energy if"
" available); the corresponding basis sets are returned in variable "
"BASISSETS. The results can be printed, e.g., in a table as shown above, or "
"used otherwise. The above input produces the table"
msgstr ""
"结果能量将返回到变量 ENERGR（参考能量）、ENERGY（总能量）和 ENERGD（如果可用，则为 Davidson "
"校正能量）中；对应的基组则返回到变量 BASISSETS 中。结果可以打印，例如，如上所示的表格中，或以其他方式使用。上述输入会产生表格"

msgid ""
"The extrapolated total energy is also returned in variable ECBS (ECBSD for "
"Davidson corrected energy if available)."
msgstr "外推的总能量也返回到变量 ECBS 中（如果可用，Davidson 校正能量则返回到 ECBSD 中）。"

msgid ""
"In order to extrapolate the HF energy as well (using exponential "
"extrapolation), three energies are needed. One can modify the input as "
"follows:"
msgstr "为了同时外推HF能量（使用指数外推），需要三个能量值。可以按如下方式修改输入："

msgid "``extrapolate,basis=avtz:avqz:av5z,method_r=ex1,npc=2``"
msgstr "``extrapolate,basis=avtz:avqz:av5z,method_r=ex1,npc=2``"

msgid ""
"``method_r`` determines the method for extrapolating the reference energy "
"(in this case a single exponential); ``npc=2`` means that only the last two "
"energies should be used to extrapolate the correlation energy (by default, a"
" least square fit to all given energies is used). This yields"
msgstr ""
"``method_r`` 确定外推参考能量的方法（本例中为单指数）；\\ ``npc=2`` "
"表示仅使用最后两个能量值来外推相关能（默认情况下，使用对所有给定能量值的最小二乘拟合）。这将得到"

msgid ""
"Rather than using the default procedure as above, one can also specify a "
"procedure used to carry out the energy calculation, e.g."
msgstr "除了使用上述默认过程外，也可以指定用于执行能量计算的过程，例如"

msgid ""
"Alternatively, the energies can be provided via variables ``EREF``, "
"``ECORR``, ``ETOT`` etc. These must be vectors, holding as many values as "
"basis sets are given."
msgstr ""
"或者，能量可以通过变量 ``EREF``\\ 、\\ ``ECORR``\\ 、\\ ``ETOT`` "
"等提供。这些必须是向量，包含与给定基组数量相同的值。"

msgid "Options"
msgstr "选项"

msgid "The possible options and extrapolation methods are:"
msgstr "可能的选项和外推方法有："

msgid "Extrapolation functionals"
msgstr "外推泛函"

msgid ""
"``LX`` :math:`E_{n} = E_{\\tt CBS} + \\sum_{i=1}^{nx} A_i \\cdot "
"(n+p)^{-x(i)}`"
msgstr ""
"``LX`` :math:`E_{n} = E_{\\tt CBS} + \\sum_{i=1}^{nx} A_i \\cdot "
"(n+p)^{-x(i)}`"

msgid "``EX1`` :math:`E_{n} =E_{\\tt CBS}+A\\cdot \\exp(-C\\cdot n)`"
msgstr "``EX1`` :math:`E_{n} =E_{\\tt CBS}+A\\cdot \\exp(-C\\cdot n)`"

msgid "``EX2`` :math:`E_{n} =E_{\\tt CBS}+A\\cdot \\exp(-(n-1))+B\\cdot\\exp(-(n-1)^2)`"
msgstr ""
"``EX2`` :math:`E_{n} =E_{\\tt CBS}+A\\cdot "
"\\exp(-(n-1))+B\\cdot\\exp(-(n-1)^2)`"

msgid ""
"``KM`` Two-point formula for extrapolating the HF reference energy, as "
"proposed by A. Karton and J. M. L. Martin, Theor. Chem. Acc. **115**, 330 "
"(2006): :math:`E_{\\rm HF,n}=E_{\\rm HF,CBS} +A (n+1)\\cdot \\exp(-9 "
"\\sqrt{n})`. Use ``METHOD_R=KM`` for this."
msgstr ""
"``KM`` 用于外推 HF 参考能的双点公式，由 A. Karton 和 J. M. L. Martin 提出，Theor. Chem. Acc. "
"**115**, 330 (2006): :math:`E_{\\rm HF,n}=E_{\\rm HF,CBS} +A (n+1)\\cdot "
"\\exp(-9 \\sqrt{n})`\\ 。使用 ``METHOD_R=KM`` 来启用此方法。"

msgid "The following example shows various possibilities for extrapolation:"
msgstr "以下示例展示了外推的各种可能性："

msgid ""
"The second example shows extrapolations of MRCI energies. In this case both "
"the MRCI and the MRCI+Q energies are extrapolated."
msgstr "第二个示例展示了 MRCI 能量的外推。在这种情况下，MRCI 和 MRCI+Q 的能量都会被外推。"

msgid "Geometry optimization using extrapolated energies"
msgstr "使用外推能量进行几何优化"

msgid ""
"Geometry optimizations are possible by using numerical gradients obtained "
"from extrapolated energies. Analytical energy gradients cannot be used."
msgstr "通过使用从外推能量获得的数值梯度，可以进行几何优化。无法使用解析能量梯度。"

msgid "The following possibilities exist:"
msgstr "存在以下可能性："

msgid ""
"1.) If ``OPTG`` directly follows the ``EXTRAPOLATE`` command, the "
"extrapolated energy is optimized automatically (only variable settings may "
"occur between ``EXTRAPOLATE`` and ``OPTG``)."
msgstr ""
"1.) 如果 ``OPTG`` 直接跟在 ``EXTRAPOLATE`` 命令之后，外推能量将被自动优化（在 ``EXTRAPOLATE`` 和 "
"``OPTG`` 之间只能出现变量设置）。"

msgid "Examples:"
msgstr "示例："

msgid "Extrapolating the energy for the last command:"
msgstr "对最后一条命令的能量进行外推："

msgid "Extrapolating the energy computed in a procedure:"
msgstr "对过程中计算出的能量进行外推："

msgid ""
"Note that this is not possible if ``EXTRAPOLATE`` gets the input energies "
"from variables."
msgstr "请注意，如果 ``EXTRAPOLATE`` 从变量获取输入能量，则此操作不可行。"

msgid "2.) Using a procedure for the extrapolation:"
msgstr "2.) 使用过程进行外推："

msgid ""
"By default, variable ``ECBS`` is optimized, but other variables (e.g. "
"``ECBSD``) can be specified using the ``VARIABLE`` option on the ``OPTG`` "
"command."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，变量 ``ECBS`` 会被优化，但也可以通过 ``OPTG`` 命令的 ``VARIABLE`` 选项指定其他变量（例如 "
"``ECBSD``\\ ）。"

msgid "Harmonic vibrational frequencies using extrapolated energies"
msgstr "使用外推能量的谐波振动频率"

msgid "This is possible by defining the extrapolation in a procedure:"
msgstr "这可以通过在过程中定义外推来实现："

msgid ""
"Basis set incompleteness error correction using a DFT model of short-ranged "
"electron interactions"
msgstr "使用短程电子相互作用的DFT模型进行基组不完备性误差校正"

msgid ""
"As an alternative to basis set extrapolations or using F12 correlation "
"methods, the BSIE (basis set incompleteness error) to electron correlation "
"energies can also be corrected by using a density based model by Giner *et "
"al.*, see:"
msgstr ""
"作为基组外推或使用F12相关方法的替代方案，电子相关能的BSIE（基组不完备性误差）也可以通过使用Giner等人提出的基于密度的模型进行校正，参见："

msgid ""
"This basis-set correction relies on a mapping between wave-function "
"calculations in a finite basis set and range-separated DFT (RSDFT) through "
"the definition of an effective non-divergent interaction corresponding to "
"the electron–electron Coulomb interaction projected in the finite basis set."
" This enables the use of RSDFT-type complementary correlation density "
"functionals to recover the dominant part of the short-range correlation "
"effects missing in this finite basis set."
msgstr ""
"此基组校正依赖于有限基组中的波函数计算与范围分离DFT（RSDFT）之间的映射，通过定义一个对应于有限基组中投影的电子-"
"电子库仑相互作用的有效非发散相互作用来实现。这使得能够使用RSDFT类型的互补相关密度泛函来恢复该有限基组中缺失的短程相关效应的主要部分。"

msgid ""
"For example, to compute the extrapolated MP2 energy with the DFT correction "
"the following input can be used for Molpro"
msgstr "例如，要计算带有DFT校正的外推MP2能量，可以为Molpro使用以下输入"

msgid ""
"Note that the DFT correction may be used in conjunction with any wave "
"function correlation method which suffers from the wrong description of the "
"interelectronic cusp with finite basis sets, so in the above example the MP2"
" method could be replaced with any other electron correlation method "
"available in Molpro."
msgstr ""
"请注意，DFT校正可与任何因有限基组对电子间尖点描述不当而受影响的波函数相关方法结合使用，因此在上面的示例中，MP2方法可以替换为Molpro中可用的任何其他电子相关方法。"

msgid ""
"The reference energy term is not corrected for the BSIE in the example "
"above. One may do so by using either the basis set extrapolation approach "
"described in this section:"
msgstr "上例中的参考能项未针对 BSIE 进行校正。可以通过使用本节描述的基组外推方法来实现："

msgid ""
"or by adding the CABS singles correction to the HF energy computed in the "
"small basis set"
msgstr "或者通过将 CABS 单激发修正添加到在小基组中计算的 HF 能量中"

msgid ""
"see also the corresponding subsection in `Explicitly correlated methods "
"<explicitly_correlated_methods.html#cabs-singles-correction>`__"
msgstr ""
"另请参阅 `显式相关方法 <explicitly_correlated_methods.html#cabs-singles-correction>`__"
" 中的相应小节"

msgid "In general the density based BSIE correction can be called as"
msgstr "通常，基于密度的 BSIE 校正可以按如下方式调用"

msgid "with the following options"
msgstr "包含以下选项"

msgid ""
"``CORE`` number of core orbitals (normally required, since by default all "
"orbitals are included). When symmetry is used an array of the form "
"[nc1,nc2,...] must be given to the option for specifying the core orbitals "
"in each symmetry"
msgstr ""
"``CORE`` 芯轨道的数量（通常需要，因为默认包含所有轨道）。使用对称性时，必须向该选项提供一个形式为 [nc1,nc2,…] "
"的数组，以指定每个对称性中的芯轨道"

msgid ""
"``ORB`` the record storing the orbital coefficients. If omitted, the "
"orbitals from the last SCF calculation are being used."
msgstr "``ORB`` 存储轨道系数的记录。如果省略，则使用最后一次 SCF 计算中的轨道。"

msgid ""
"``TOLORB`` screening threshold for the calculation of the basis functions on"
" the grid."
msgstr "``TOLORB`` 在格点上计算基函数的筛选阈值。"

msgid "``CFUN`` set correlation functional (default: ``CFUN=PBEC``)."
msgstr "``CFUN`` 设置相关泛函（默认：\\ ``CFUN=PBEC``\\ ）。"

msgid ""
"Since the calculation of the BSIE correction requires a numerical "
"integration on a quadrature grid, the grid setting described `here "
"<the_density_functional_program.html#numerical-integration-grid-control-"
"grid>`__ also can affect the results of the correction. In practice, "
"however, the default settings for DFT integrations should be adequate."
msgstr ""
"由于 BSIE 校正的计算需要在求积网格上进行数值积分，因此 `此处 "
"<the_density_functional_program.html#numerical-integration-grid-control-"
"grid>`__ 描述的网格设置也会影响校正的结果。然而在实践中，DFT 积分的默认设置应该是足够的。"

msgid ""
"where the MP2Fit fitting basis set is used for the ``BASCORR`` program which"
" has been found to yield better results than the corresponding JKFit basis "
"set that we use for the SCF calculation in the example above."
msgstr ""
"其中 MP2Fit 拟合基组用于 ``BASCORR`` 程序，已发现其比我们在上例中用于 SCF 计算的相应 JKFit 基组能产生更好的结果。"

msgid ""
"By default the PBE correlation functional ``cfun=PBEC`` is used to describe "
"the short ranged correlation contribution of the BASCORR model. It is "
"possible to choose a different correlation functional by using the ``cfun`` "
"option. This, however, should normally not be changed, because the basis set"
" correction has so far only been tested for the PBEC functional. "
"Furthermore, note that Molpro does not distinguish between correlation and "
"exchange functionals and will not exit with an error if the BASCORR program "
"is used with improper exchange functional."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，使用 PBE 相关泛函 ``cfun=PBEC`` 来描述 BASCORR 模型的短程相关贡献。可以通过使用 ``cfun`` "
"选项选择不同的相关泛函。然而，这通常不应更改，因为基组校正迄今为止仅针对 PBEC 泛函进行了测试。此外，请注意 Molpro "
"不区分相关泛函和交换泛函，并且如果 BASCORR 程序使用了不正确的交换泛函，它不会报错退出。"

msgid ""
"The simplest way to perform extrapolations for standard methods like MP2 or "
"CCSD(T) is to use, e.g."
msgstr "对MP2或CCSD(T)等标准方法进行外推的最简单方式是使用，例如"

msgid ""
"**``BASIS``\\ =\\ *basissets*** Specify as set of correlation consistent "
"basis sets, separated by colons."
msgstr "**``BASIS``\\ =\\ *\\ basissets*** 指定为一组相关一致基组，以冒号分隔。"

msgid ""
"**``PROC``\\ =\\ *procname*** Specify a procedure to run the energy "
"calculations"
msgstr "**``PROC``\\ =\\ *\\ procname*** 指定要运行能量计算的过程"

msgid ""
"**``STARTCMD``\\ =\\ *command*** Start command for the energy calculations: "
"the sequence of commands from ``STARTCMD`` and the current ``EXTRAPOLATE`` "
"is run. ``STARTCMD`` must come before the extrapolate command in the input."
msgstr ""
"**``STARTCMD``\\ =\\ *\\ command*** 能量计算的启动命令：将运行从\\ ``STARTCMD``\\ 到当前\\ "
"``EXTRAPOLATE``\\ 的命令序列。\\ ``STARTCMD``\\ 必须出现在输入中外推命令之前。"

msgid ""
"**``METHOD``\\ =\\ *key*** Specifies a keyword to define the extrapolation "
"function, see section `extrapolation functionals "
"<basis_set_extrapolation.html#extrapolation-functionals>`__."
msgstr ""
"**``METHOD``\\ =\\ *\\ key*** 指定用于定义外推函数的关键字，参见\\ `外推泛函 "
"<basis_set_extrapolation.html#extrapolation-functionals>`__\\ 一节。"

msgid ""
"**``METHOD_C``\\ =\\ *key*** Specifies a keyword to define the extrapolation"
" function for the correlation energy, see section `extrapolation functionals"
" <basis_set_extrapolation.html#extrapolation-functionals>`__."
msgstr ""
"**``METHOD_C``\\ =\\ *\\ key*** 指定用于定义相关能外推函数的关键字，参见\\ `外推泛函 "
"<basis_set_extrapolation.html#extrapolation-functionals>`__\\ 一节。"

msgid ""
"**``METHOD_R``\\ =\\ *key*** Specifies a keyword to define the extrapolation"
" function for the reference energy, see section `extrapolation functionals "
"<basis_set_extrapolation.html#extrapolation-functionals>`__."
msgstr ""
"**``METHOD_R``\\ =\\ *\\ key*** 指定用于定义参考能外推函数的关键字，参见\\ `外推泛函 "
"<basis_set_extrapolation.html#extrapolation-functionals>`__\\ 一节。"

msgid ""
"**``VARIABLE``\\ =\\ *name*** Specifies a variable name; this variable "
"should contain the energies to be extrapolated."
msgstr "**``VARIABLE``\\ =\\ *\\ name*** 指定变量名；该变量应包含待外推的能量。"

msgid ""
"**``ETOT``\\ =\\ *variable*** Provide the total energies in *variable* (a "
"vector with the same number of energies as basis sets are given) If only "
"ETOT but not EREF is given, the total energy is extrapolated."
msgstr ""
"**``ETOT``\\ =\\ *\\ variable*** 在*\\ "
"variable*中提供总能量（一个向量，其能量个数与给定的基组数相同）。如果只给出ETOT而未给出EREF，则对总能量进行外推。"

msgid ""
"**``EREF``\\ =\\ *variable*** Provide the reference energies to be "
"extrapolated in *variable* (a vector with the same number of energies as "
"basis sets are given)"
msgstr ""
"**``EREF``\\ =\\ *\\ variable*** 在*\\ "
"variable*中提供待外推的参考能（一个向量，其能量个数与给定的基组数相同）"

msgid ""
"**``ECORR``\\ =\\ *variable*** Provide the correlation energies to be "
"extrapolated in *variable* (a vector with the same number of energies as "
"basis sets are given)"
msgstr ""
"**``ECORR``\\ =\\ *\\ variable*** 在*\\ "
"variable*中提供待外推的相关能（一个向量，其能量个数与给定的基组数相同）"

msgid ""
"**``ECORRD``\\ =\\ *variable*** Provide the Davidson corrected correlation "
"energies to be extrapolated in *variable* (a vector with the same number of "
"energies as basis sets are given). If both ``ECORR`` and ``ECORRD`` are "
"given, both will be extrapolated."
msgstr ""
"**``ECORRD``\\ =\\ *\\ variable*** 在*\\ "
"variable*中提供待外推的Davidson校正相关能（一个向量，其能量个数与给定的基组数相同）。如果同时给出\\ ``ECORR``\\ 和\\ "
"``ECORRD``\\ ，则两者均会被外推。"

msgid ""
"**``MINB``\\ =\\ *number*** First basis set to be used for extrapolation "
"(default 1)"
msgstr "**``MINB``\\ =\\ *\\ number*** 用于外推的第一个基组（默认1）"

msgid ""
"**``MAXB``\\ =\\ *number*** Last basis set to be used for extrapolation "
"(default number of basis sets)"
msgstr "**``MAXB``\\ =\\ *\\ number*** 用于外推的最后一个基组（默认为基组数）"

msgid ""
"**``NPR``\\ =\\ *number*** If given, the last NPR values are used for "
"extrapolating the reference energy. NPR must be smaller or equal to the "
"number of basis sets."
msgstr "**``NPR``\\ =\\ *\\ number*** 如果给出，则使用最后NPR个值外推参考能。NPR必须小于或等于基组数。"

msgid ""
"**``NPC``\\ =\\ *number*** If given, the last NPC values are used for "
"extrapolating the reference energy. NPC must be smaller or equal to the "
"number of basis sets."
msgstr "**``NPC``\\ =\\ *\\ number*** 如果给出，则使用最后NPC个值外推参考能。NPC必须小于或等于基组数。"

msgid ""
"**``XR``\\ =\\ *array*** Provide a vector of exponents to be used for "
"defining the extrapolation functional for the reference energy when using "
"the ``LX`` functional."
msgstr "**``XR``\\ =\\ *\\ array*** 提供一个指数向量，用于在使用\\ ``LX``\\ 泛函时定义参考能的外推泛函。"

msgid ""
"**``XC``\\ =\\ *array*** Provide a vector of exponents to be used for "
"defining the extrapolation functional for the correlation energy when using "
"the ``LX`` functional."
msgstr "**``XC``\\ =\\ *\\ array*** 提供一个指数向量，用于在使用\\ ``LX``\\ 泛函时定义相关能的外推泛函。"

msgid ""
"**``PR``\\ =\\ *array*** Provide the constant :math:`p` to be used for "
"defining the extrapolation functional for the reference energy."
msgstr "**``PR``\\ =\\ *\\ array*** 提供用于定义参考能外推泛函的常数\\ :math:`p`\\ 。"

msgid ""
"**``PC``\\ =\\ *array*** Provide the constant :math:`p` to be used for "
"defining the extrapolation functional for the correlation energy."
msgstr "**``PC``\\ =\\ *\\ array*** 提供用于定义相关能外推泛函的常数\\ :math:`p`\\ 。"

msgid ""
"The extrapolation functional is chosen by a keyword with the ``METHOD``, "
"``METHOD_R``, and/or ``METHOD_C`` options. The default functional is ``L3``."
" In the following, :math:`n` is the cardinal number of the basis set (e.g., "
"2 for VDZ, 3 for VTZ etc), and :math:`x` is an arbitrary number. :math:`p` "
"is a constant given either by the ``PR`` or ``PC`` options (default "
":math:`p=0`). ``X`` is a number or a vector given either by the ``XR`` or "
"``XC`` options (only for ``LX``; :math:`nx` is the number of elements "
"provided in ``X``). :math:`A`, :math:`B`, :math:`A_i` are the fitting "
"coefficients that are optimized by least-squares fits."
msgstr ""
"外推泛函通过\\ ``METHOD``\\ 、\\ ``METHOD_R``\\ 和/或\\ ``METHOD_C``\\ "
"选项的关键字来选择。默认泛函为\\ ``L3``\\ 。下文中，\\ :math:`n`\\ 为基组的基数（例如，VDZ为2，VTZ为3等），\\ "
":math:`x`\\ 为任意数。\\ :math:`p`\\ 为由\\ ``PR``\\ 或\\ ``PC``\\ 选项给出的常数（默认\\ "
":math:`p=0`\\ ）。\\ ``X``\\ 为由\\ ``XR``\\ 或\\ ``XC``\\ 选项给出的一个数或向量（仅用于\\ "
"``LX``\\ ；\\ :math:`nx`\\ 为\\ ``X``\\ 中提供的元素个数）。\\ :math:`A`\\ 、\\ "
":math:`B`\\ 、\\ :math:`A_i`\\ 为通过最小二乘拟合优化的拟合系数。"

msgid "**``L``\\ :math:`x`** :math:`E_{n} = E_{\\tt CBS} + A \\cdot (n+p)^{-x}`"
